“听着，你在这里——”

08:42.586 --> 08:44.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:44.689 --> 08:48.241
- It's time to
have tea and cakes.
- 是时候了
喝茶和蛋糕。

08:48.310 --> 08:49.931
- Get him!
- 抓住他！

08:50.000 --> 08:53.000
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

08:53.068 --> 08:54.931
[yelling]
[大喊]

08:55.000 --> 08:57.793
[whooshing]
[呼啸]

08:57.862 --> 08:59.896
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

08:59.965 --> 09:02.413
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:02.482 --> 09:04.586
all: Aw.
全体：噢。

09:04.655 --> 09:08.862
- Yes, Billy, two plus two
still equals four.
- 是的，比利，二加二
仍然等于四。

09:08.931 --> 09:11.448
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:11.517 --> 09:12.517
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:12.586 --> 09:14.068
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

09:14.137 --> 09:16.413
- Breaking news:
The Dirty Bubble
- 突发新闻：
肮脏的泡沫

09:16.482 --> 09:18.655
just wiped all the teacher's
dirty looks
刚刚把老师的都擦掉了
肮脏的外表

09:18.724 --> 09:22.655
right off their faces!
Who will be next?
就在他们脸上！
下一个会是谁？

09:22.724 --> 09:23.931
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:24.000 --> 09:25.965
No more pencils,
no more books,
不再有铅笔，
不再有书了，

09:26.034 --> 09:28.517
no more news guy's dirty looks.
不再有新闻人的肮脏外表。

09:28.586 --> 09:29.896
[laughs]
[笑]

09:29.965 --> 09:31.758
- No!
- 不！

09:31.827 --> 09:33.344
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:33.413 --> 09:37.172
Oh, that got in my mouth!
哦，那东西到我嘴里了！

09:37.241 --> 09:39.448
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:39.517 --> 09:40.620
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:40.689 --> 09:42.862
- Sorry, old chum,
but from now on,
- 对不起，老朋友，
但从现在开始，

09:42.931 --> 09:45.827
you're going to have
to stay clean for good.
你将会有
永远保持清洁。

09:45.896 --> 09:49.862
- Begone, hygiene.
I'm too big to stay clean!
- 走开，讲卫生。
我太大了，无法保持干净！

09:49.931 --> 09:51.862
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:51.931 --> 09:53.517
- Ah!
- 啊！

09:53.586 --> 09:54.931
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:55.000 --> 09:57.000
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:57.068 --> 09:59.655
Ow!
It's on now.
噢！
现在已经开始了

09:59.724 --> 10:01.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:01.103 --> 10:04.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:04.827 --> 10:06.448
[yells]
[喊叫]

10:07.965 --> 10:09.758
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:09.827 --> 10:12.068
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:12.137 --> 10:14.103
Help, help!
Call the cops!
救命，救命！
报警！

10:14.172 --> 10:17.034
Call Mr. Krabs!
Call my mommy!
给蟹老板打电话吧！
叫我妈妈！

10:17.103 --> 10:18.551
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:21.862 --> 10:24.862
- I think for dessert,
I'll eat more dirt!
- 我觉得甜点
我要吃更多的泥土！

10:24.931 --> 10:26.241
[laughs]
[笑]

10:26.310 --> 10:28.827
- Not Goo Lagoon!
- 不是古泻湖！

10:28.896 --> 10:30.896
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

10:30.965 --> 10:33.620
And to my beloved pet, Gary,
I bequeath my pineapple
还有我心爱的宠物加里，
我遗赠我的菠萝

10:33.689 --> 10:36.172
and my tool shed and
my mailbox and Patrick.
和我的工具棚和
我的邮箱和帕特里克。

10:36.241 --> 10:38.137
[cries]
[哭声]

10:38.206 --> 10:40.172
What?
Wow.
什么？
哇。

10:40.241 --> 10:42.724
Sometimes, I forget
just how absorbent I am!
有时，我会忘记
我的吸收力多么强啊！

10:42.793 --> 10:44.103
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

10:44.172 --> 10:48.275
- Wait, what?
Oh, stop spinning, you sponge.
- 等等，什么？
哦，别再旋转了，你这个海绵。

10:48.344 --> 10:50.344
You're stealing my grunge.
你偷了我的垃圾。

10:50.413 --> 10:54.620
Uh, uh, stuff that rhymes!
Ah!
呃，呃，押韵的东西！
啊!

10:54.689 --> 10:56.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:56.655 --> 10:58.034
[burps]
[打嗝]

10:58.103 --> 11:01.724
- I may be a squirt,
but I'm still full of dirt.
- 我可能是个水鬼，
但我还是满身泥土。

11:01.793 --> 11:03.413
[laughs]
[笑]

11:03.482 --> 11:07.137
- Oh, little mini-DB
is so cute.
- 哦，小迷你数据库
太可爱了。

11:07.206 --> 11:08.448
- Ah!
- 啊！

11:08.517 --> 11:10.034
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

11:10.103 --> 11:12.241
- We got him!
- 我们抓到他了！

11:12.310 --> 11:15.103
- Every time I wash dishes,
I'll think of you.
- 每次洗碗的时候
我会想你的。

11:15.172 --> 11:17.275
- Hm, every time
I have nightmares,
- 嗯，每次
我做恶梦，

11:17.344 --> 11:18.862
I'll think of you, too.
我也会想你的

11:18.931 --> 11:22.000
- Thank you, citizen.
We'll take it from here.
- 谢谢你，公民。
我们将从这里拿走它。

11:22.068 --> 11:24.896
- It was a dirty job,
but somebody had to do it!
- 这是一项肮脏的工作
但必须有人这么做！

11:24.965 --> 11:25.896
[laughs]
[笑]

11:25.965 --> 11:26.931
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

11:27.000 --> 11:28.310
- Just kidding!
- 只是在开玩笑！

11:28.379 --> 11:31.896
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:31.965 --> 11:33.827
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

11:33.896 --> 11:35.241
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

11:35.310 --> 11:37.310
all: Gesundheit.
全部：Gesundheit。

11:37.379 --> 11:40.862
- Thank you.
Got some schmutz on you there.
- 谢谢。
你那里有一些坏事。

11:40.931 --> 11:42.965
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

11:43.034 --> 11:46.931
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

11:47.000 --> 11:54.206
♪ ♪
